WEBVTT

00:38.487 --> 00:46.537
Heavy Knight

00:38.967 --> 00:40.447
<b><i>The Heavy Knight.</i></b>

00:40.447 --> 00:46.537
<b><i>It is a class specialized in defense that 
draws enemy attacks to protect allies.</i></b>

00:47.837 --> 00:53.497
<b><i>But compared to other 
defensive classes, it lacks versatility.</i></b>

00:54.347 --> 00:58.887
<b><i>Its incredibly weak offensive abilities 
make it difficult to level up.</i></b>

01:02.007 --> 01:04.007
As a result

01:02.717 --> 01:04.007
<b><i>As a result...</i></b>

01:05.537 --> 01:09.537
<b><i>it's known as a truly 
unfortunate defective class.</i></b>

01:56.917 --> 02:03.367
<b>I heard a clown 
had joined this Raid Quest.</b>

02:03.817 --> 02:06.007
<b>It must be you, Elymas.</b>

02:07.117 --> 02:12.827
<b>There are plenty of newbies like you 
who underestimate guilds and monsters.</b>

02:13.307 --> 02:16.947
<b>You beat an Ariandype at level 12?</b>

02:16.947 --> 02:18.997
<b>Don't be stupid!</b>

02:19.277 --> 02:21.587
<b>Adventuring isn't that easy!</b>

02:21.587 --> 02:24.587
<b>I'll teach you a lesson!</b>

02:40.947 --> 02:42.577
<b><i>Well, this sucks.</i></b>

03:21.437 --> 03:22.687
<b>Loading</b>

03:33.947 --> 03:35.257
<b>Loading</b>

03:46.587 --> 03:47.877
<b>Loading</b>

03:56.137 --> 03:56.887
<b>Loading</b>

03:58.387 --> 04:03.977
<b>Begin Adventure</b>

03:58.387 --> 04:03.977
<b>Begin Adventure</b>

04:15.077 --> 04:19.037
<b>Episode 3\h\h\h\hThe Raid Quest</b>

04:46.827 --> 04:48.467
<b><i>Well, this sucks.</i></b>

04:49.497 --> 04:53.237
<b><i>But raid quests are 
a rare chance at promotion.</i></b>

04:53.237 --> 04:55.577
<b><i>I can't afford to miss this one.</i></b>

04:57.897 --> 04:59.037
<b><i>What I should do is...</i></b>

05:00.957 --> 05:03.377
<b>I look forward to working with you.</b>

05:12.557 --> 05:14.427
<b>I don't like this, but fine.</b>

05:15.157 --> 05:18.167
<b>Okay, Teal. Let's get started.</b>

05:19.297 --> 05:21.227
<b>Certainly, Mr. Gowtan.</b>

05:28.917 --> 05:29.967
<b>Search.</b>

05:35.077 --> 05:39.207
<b><i>Search is a skill 
that detects creatures in the area.</i></b>

05:40.277 --> 05:43.407
<b><i>It's a rare skill at low levels.</i></b>

05:56.757 --> 06:01.227
<b>There's a horde of roughly 
thirty enemy monsters.</b>

06:01.567 --> 06:03.767
<b>Good work, Teal.</b>

06:03.767 --> 06:07.957
<b>Yes, sir. I happen to possess 
an exceptional skill.</b>

06:08.647 --> 06:12.527
<b>I hope you'll grant me 
that promotion to rank E.</b>

06:16.197 --> 06:18.407
<b>Oh? What's this?</b>

06:18.407 --> 06:26.167
<b>Your bizarre—rather, unusual behavior 
at the guild has sparked rumors, Elymas.</b>

06:26.637 --> 06:30.167
<b><i>Judging by his equipment, 
he must be a Red Mage.</i></b>

06:30.667 --> 06:35.637
<b>I'd certainly be impressed if 
all the rumors were true.</b>

06:31.167 --> 06:35.417
<b><i>They have high physical abilities and 
can learn attack spells, healing spells,</i></b>

06:35.417 --> 06:38.527
<b><i>and a broad range of support spells.</i></b>

06:35.637 --> 06:38.847
<b>It really is such a shame.</b>

06:39.167 --> 06:42.947
<b>Sorry you're stuck with a defective class.</b>

06:42.947 --> 06:45.247
<b>I appreciate your concern.</b>

06:46.057 --> 06:49.117
<b>But I like this class.</b>

06:58.847 --> 07:00.197
<b>You think you're tough?</b>

07:01.037 --> 07:03.847
<b>Well, just don't hold us back.</b>

07:08.047 --> 07:12.417
<b><i>If anything, Red Mage is 
the more challenging class.</i></b>

07:13.307 --> 07:17.497
<b><i>At first glance, 
they seem capable of anything,</i></b>

07:17.497 --> 07:21.177
<b><i>but in the game, they were known 
as a typical jack-of-all-trades.</i></b>

07:21.967 --> 07:24.597
<b><i>But this world isn't the game.</i></b>

07:24.597 --> 07:28.567
<b><i>Naturally, people favor classes 
that are easy to use.</i></b>

07:35.407 --> 07:37.357
<b>Let's review the situation.</b>

07:37.647 --> 07:41.797
<b>This undead horde is led by a Ghoul Head.</b>

07:42.327 --> 07:43.697
<b>That's a strong monster.</b>

07:43.987 --> 07:47.337
<b>As a D-rank adventurer, I'll handle it.</b>

07:47.337 --> 07:49.547
<b>All of you, keep your distance 
and handle the weaklings.</b>

07:49.547 --> 07:51.107
<b>You won't protect us?</b>

07:51.107 --> 07:53.457
<b>I won't protect anyone 
who gets caught in my fight.</b>

07:53.457 --> 07:55.957
<b>Seriously?</b>

07:54.967 --> 07:55.957
<b>I'm standing in the back.</b>

07:56.327 --> 07:59.217
<b>Mr. Gowtan's only focusing on the boss?</b>

07:59.587 --> 08:02.407
<b>I thought we'd just have 
to stand next to him.</b>

08:07.687 --> 08:11.407
<b><i>The Ghoul Head is around level 30.</i></b>

08:11.407 --> 08:12.937
<b><i>It has no attack skills,</i></b>

08:13.247 --> 08:17.317
<b><i>but its Hades Breath skill that turns 
corpses into low-level Wights is a pain.</i></b>

08:18.837 --> 08:24.027
<b><i>But we have Gowtan, 
a D-rank adventurer around level 40.</i></b>

08:24.757 --> 08:27.717
<b><i>If things go smoothly, we should win.</i></b>

08:30.077 --> 08:31.037
<b><i>However...</i></b>

08:31.457 --> 08:32.807
<b><i>We're dead.</i></b>

08:32.577 --> 08:37.057
<b>Cowardice</b>

08:32.807 --> 08:34.647
<b><i>We're definitely going to die.</i></b>

08:34.647 --> 08:35.987
<b><i>Cowardice.</i></b>

08:37.397 --> 08:39.047
<b><i>Weakling adventurers.</i></b>

08:40.087 --> 08:42.547
<b>Arrogance</b>

08:41.037 --> 08:42.087
<b><i>Arrogance.</i></b>

08:43.437 --> 08:46.667
<b><i>Newbies who expected raids to be easy,</i></b>

08:46.667 --> 08:49.757
<b><i>and a careless leader 
who won't look after his team.</i></b>

08:51.757 --> 08:54.447
<b><i>The odds we'll all survive are 80%.</i></b>

08:56.207 --> 09:01.407
<b><i>That's decent for a game, but in this 
world, death is more than just a setback.</i></b>

09:08.707 --> 09:09.617
<b>Gowtan.</b>

09:11.737 --> 09:15.567
<b>Shouldn't you give 
more specific instructions?</b>

09:20.277 --> 09:21.547
<b>What did you say?</b>

09:21.887 --> 09:26.047
<b>The report on the undead horde 
may not be totally accurate.</b>

09:26.657 --> 09:29.447
<b>It'll be too late if we wait 
for the worst to happen.</b>

09:31.317 --> 09:32.787
<b>What is he saying?</b>

09:31.677 --> 09:34.397
<b>He's making a suggestion to Gowtan?</b>

09:33.457 --> 09:35.347
<b>Damn Heavy Knight...</b>

09:34.397 --> 09:36.057
<b>Is he insane?</b>

09:38.657 --> 09:42.477
<b>You think you can order me around?</b>

09:51.307 --> 09:52.257
<b>No.</b>

09:53.577 --> 09:58.287
<b>I'm simply anxious because I'm
 a low level and inexperienced adventurer.</b>

10:00.827 --> 10:02.867
<b>So are the others.</b>

10:03.497 --> 10:07.427
<b>For a veteran like you, 
this might be business as usual,</b>

10:08.217 --> 10:10.477
<b>but we'd appreciate more instructions.</b>

10:15.877 --> 10:18.937
<b>I'm not a babysitter, but fine.</b>

10:19.517 --> 10:21.317
<b>Hold on.</b>

10:21.997 --> 10:24.567
<b><i>We'd</i> appreciate it?</b>

10:27.837 --> 10:33.827
<b>Only those with defective classes 
like yours are scared of weak undead.</b>

10:34.107 --> 10:39.417
<b>I didn't think you'd go crying to 
Mr. Gowtan just before we faced them.</b>

10:41.707 --> 10:43.717
<b>I'm scared, too...</b>

10:48.747 --> 10:52.967
<b>We don't need instructions, Mr. Gowtan.</b>

10:53.287 --> 10:57.477
<b>Cowards can stay out of our way 
by running to the rear.</b>

10:58.337 --> 11:00.747
<b>Right, Mr. Gowtan?</b>

11:08.397 --> 11:09.407
<b>When did they get here?</b>

11:46.557 --> 11:50.777
<b>We don't need instructions, Mr. Gowtan.</b>

11:51.117 --> 11:56.187
<b>Cowards can stay out of our way 
by running to the rear.</b>

11:56.187 --> 11:58.517
<b>Right, Mr. Gowtan?</b>

12:35.457 --> 12:36.407
<b>What are you doing?</b>

12:36.697 --> 12:40.197
<b>Teal, Paul! Clear the way for me!</b>

12:40.197 --> 12:41.077
<b>What?!</b>

12:41.077 --> 12:42.367
<b>Come with me!</b>

12:42.367 --> 12:43.597
<b>Y-Yes, sir!</b>

12:58.057 --> 13:01.387
<b><i>Its club doesn't seem 
to be anything special.</i></b>

13:02.197 --> 13:04.127
<b><i>They should be fine.</i></b>

13:06.707 --> 13:10.227
<b>Let's take care of that 
big head's followers.</b>

13:10.227 --> 13:11.397
<b>What?!</b>

13:11.697 --> 13:14.697
<b>You want us to charge 
into all those monsters?</b>

13:16.877 --> 13:20.907
<b>Th-They may only be Wights, 
but we're screwed if they surround us.</b>

13:20.907 --> 13:24.667
<b>I thought Mr. Gowtan 
would knock them out for us,</b>

13:24.947 --> 13:27.537
<b>but he's focusing on the boss.</b>

13:28.197 --> 13:29.667
<b><i>So that's it.</i></b>

13:29.937 --> 13:32.237
<b>I can't do this.</b>

13:31.667 --> 13:33.957
<b><i>No wonder they're so unmotivated.</i></b>

13:32.237 --> 13:34.037
<b>Nobody said it'd be like this.</b>

13:34.037 --> 13:35.737
<b>You're kidding, right?</b>

13:36.357 --> 13:40.177
<b><i>None of them have ever faced 
a monster horde before,</i></b>

13:41.377 --> 13:46.687
<b><i>much less creepy-looking undead 
without proper instructions.</i></b>

13:47.557 --> 13:49.687
<b><i>I understand why they're hesitant.</i></b>

13:52.047 --> 13:53.067
<b>Listen up.</b>

13:54.777 --> 13:57.257
<b>Form teams of three.</b>

13:57.257 --> 13:58.087
<b>What?!</b>

13:58.087 --> 14:01.907
<b>If we watch each other's backs, 
the Wights can't beat us.</b>

14:08.917 --> 14:10.377
<b>F-Fine.</b>

14:10.667 --> 14:13.757
<b>We'll do that, but what about you?</b>

14:13.757 --> 14:16.507
<b>I'll draw undead to me on the front line.</b>

14:16.507 --> 14:18.967
<b>I'll buy time for you to rally yourselves.</b>

14:19.677 --> 14:23.827
<b>Y-You seem to have some experience, 
but it's reckless to do that alone.</b>

14:23.827 --> 14:25.767
<b>You won't be able to heal fast enough.</b>

14:25.767 --> 14:29.267
<b>Plus, aren't you a slow Heavy Knight?</b>

14:34.627 --> 14:35.567
<b><i>Parry!</i></b>

14:38.617 --> 14:45.077
<b>Parry [Common Skill]
Use a sword or shield to
deflect enemy attacks and create openings</b>

14:38.957 --> 14:40.887
<b><i>Parry skill.</i></b>

14:40.887 --> 14:45.077
<b><i>Use a sword or shield to deflect 
enemy attacks and create openings.</i></b>

14:51.057 --> 14:51.767
<b>Parry!</b>

14:53.147 --> 14:54.047
<b>Parry!</b>

14:56.647 --> 14:57.647
<b>Parry!</b>

15:00.897 --> 15:01.847
<b>Disarm!</b>

15:15.047 --> 15:17.627
<b>Rampart Reflection!</b>

15:20.327 --> 15:21.867
<b>Rampart Reflection</b>

15:28.667 --> 15:30.417
<b>He wiped them out instantly!</b>

15:31.997 --> 15:36.097
<b>Don't worry. It's a Heavy Knight's job 
to attract hordes of enemies.</b>

15:36.707 --> 15:40.727
<b>If anything unexpected happens, 
tell the others right away.</b>

15:41.147 --> 15:42.927
<b>I'll help, too.</b>

15:42.927 --> 15:44.927
<b>What?!</b>

15:58.607 --> 16:02.547
<b>H-He's soloing most of the Wights.</b>

16:02.547 --> 16:05.117
<b>Isn't he a Heavy Knight?</b>

16:13.247 --> 16:16.127
<b>1 skill points acquired</b>

16:13.477 --> 16:16.127
<b><i>Level 16 reached.</i></b>

16:16.727 --> 16:20.087
<b><i>Good. Parry's working 
even better than I expected.</i></b>

16:21.597 --> 16:25.407
<b><i>And fighting this many enemies 
of this level is efficient.</i></b>

16:27.147 --> 16:28.227
<b>Display stats.</b>

16:29.097 --> 16:32.397
<b>Elymas Edvaughn</b>

16:29.097 --> 16:32.397
<b>Attack



Defense



Magic



Speed</b>

16:30.557 --> 16:32.397
<b>Class: Heavy Knight</b>

16:31.077 --> 16:32.397
<b><i>Nice.</i></b>

16:33.047 --> 16:34.727
<b><i>It's climbing steadily.</i></b>

16:35.697 --> 16:38.307
<b>Didn't he say he'd draw them to himself?</b>

16:38.307 --> 16:40.737
<b>He's practically mowing them down.</b>

16:40.737 --> 16:43.347
<b>Shouldn't we stick behind him?</b>

16:43.347 --> 16:46.787
<b>He's dependable, but he's starting 
to scare me more than the Wights.</b>

16:46.787 --> 16:48.117
<b><i>Seriously?</i></b>

17:09.107 --> 17:10.787
<b>That's most of them.</b>

17:12.907 --> 17:17.527
<b>M-Mr. Elymas, should we 
go help Mr. Gowtan?</b>

17:17.837 --> 17:21.547
<b>The Ghoul Head is a
way higher level than us.</b>

17:22.577 --> 17:25.467
<b>We should let Gowtan handle it.</b>

18:04.147 --> 18:07.327
<b>You still won't go down, 
you stubborn monster?</b>

18:09.837 --> 18:11.327
<b>Teal, Paul!</b>

18:11.327 --> 18:13.557
<b>Draw more Wights to yourselves!</b>

18:15.627 --> 18:17.787
<b>Why are you being such cowards?</b>

18:18.067 --> 18:21.217
<b>I won't give you that promotion!</b>

18:21.217 --> 18:23.417
<b>W-We know,</b>

18:23.417 --> 18:27.377
<b>but if we get any closer to the Ghoul 
Head and get caught in the fight...</b>

18:27.377 --> 18:30.417
<b>Besides, we can assist you from over here.</b>

18:47.287 --> 18:49.577
<b>Rock Shatterer!</b>

18:47.867 --> 18:49.577
<b>Rock Shatterer</b>

18:58.057 --> 18:59.207
<b>Display stats.</b>

19:00.087 --> 19:02.707
<b>Monster: Ghoul Head</b>

19:01.807 --> 19:02.707
<b><i>We've got this.</i></b>

19:03.437 --> 19:09.217
<b><i>Gowtan could knock out its 
remaining HP with one more hit, but...</i></b>

19:14.787 --> 19:16.287
<b><i>those Wights are in the way.</i></b>

19:18.867 --> 19:21.397
<b>Sh-Should we attack the Wights?</b>

19:21.397 --> 19:23.027
<b>No, we wait.</b>

19:54.957 --> 19:56.597
<b>I-It healed.</b>

19:56.897 --> 19:58.897
<b>It has Consume Corpses.</b>

19:59.817 --> 20:04.247
<b><i>It's a skill that recovers HP 
by eating corpses and undead.</i></b>

20:04.247 --> 20:07.117
<b><i>There's a low chance for 
Ghoul Heads to have it.</i></b>

20:08.097 --> 20:10.567
<b><i>That's odd, though.</i></b>

20:11.057 --> 20:16.087
<b><i>Consume Corpses shouldn't require it 
to eat so many undead to heal once.</i></b>

20:29.137 --> 20:30.127
<b>Could it be?</b>

20:30.397 --> 20:34.147
<b>It may have healed, but now 
those pesky Wights are gone.</b>

20:35.897 --> 20:36.847
<b>Gowtan, stop!</b>

20:37.217 --> 20:38.587
<b>Get away from that thing!</b>

20:38.587 --> 20:41.247
<b>I'll settle this quickly!</b>

21:14.527 --> 21:15.467
<b>What?!</b>

21:17.577 --> 21:21.317
<b><i>Ghoul Head has evolved into Mad Headder.</i></b>

21:20.017 --> 21:23.557
<b>Ghoul Head has evolved into Mad Headder</b>

21:21.317 --> 21:23.557
<b><i>Level 40 reached.</i></b>

21:56.007 --> 21:59.507
<b>Translator:
Sho Stifler

Timer:
Krzysztof Kunc

Editor:
Salem Alabanza

Quality Control:
Gabriella Alabanza

Final Quality Control:
Sriram Gurunathan</b>

23:12.377 --> 23:16.797
<b><i>An anomalous monster evolves. 
The situation couldn't be worse.</i></b>

23:17.247 --> 23:22.397
<b><i>After evolving, the Mad Headder is even 
more powerful than the high-level Gowtan.</i></b>

23:22.397 --> 23:25.987
<b><i>F-rank adventurers like us 
are no match for it.</i></b>

23:25.987 --> 23:28.937
<b><i>If I take a single direct hit, I'll die.</i></b>

23:30.677 --> 23:32.937
<b><i>Next time, "Existence Evolution."</i></b>

23:33.607 --> 23:37.407
<b><i>But this kind of situation fires me up!</i></b>
